TEXT -144 -424 Left 2 ;If RESET is set to 3.3V:\n> The OCF is high unless an OC event occurs.\n> The OCF becomes 0V when an OC event occurs.\n> After an OC event, when the OC is removed, the OCF becomes 3.3V again.\n \nIf RESET is set to 0V:\n> The OCF is set to 3.3V when there are no OC events.\n> Whenever an OC occurs, OCF is set to 0V.\n> The OCF stays latched to 0V.
